    "| Source: etactica-power-meter-em-modbus-register-map.pdf (v2.1, 2018-04-10)",
    "| Models: EM-SC (split-core current sensors), EM-FC (flexible-coil current sensors)",
    "| Protocol: Modbus RTU; FC03 read holding registers, FC16 write multiple registers",
    "| Default RS-485: 19200 baud, 8 data bits, Even parity, 1 stop bit (firmware ≥3.2 configurable)",
    "| Default Modbus slave ID: last byte of serial number (configurable via 0x2009)",
